    "detailed_description": "<strong>Pull up</strong> as a baby capybara in this 3D rage platformer! <br><br>You, a capybara, must use your jumping skills to escape the quarantined tree tower. Explore a seamless world, split into three unique levels. Reach the end of the tower and claim unimaginable rewards.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging, skill-based gameplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Climb the tower only by jumping</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Miss a jump, fall, and lose all your progress</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Start all over again</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cute theme with memorable side characters</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Several fun platforms and challenging obstacles</li></ul><br>This game will test your patience to the extreme. Good luck.<br><br>*This game is a student project created over a period of 9 weeks",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Pull up</strong> as a baby capybara in this 3D rage platformer! <br><br>You, a capybara, must use your jumping skills to escape the quarantined tree tower. Explore a seamless world, split into three unique levels. Reach the end of the tower and claim unimaginable rewards.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging, skill-based gameplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Climb the tower only by jumping</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Miss a jump, fall, and lose all your progress</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Start all over again</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cute theme with memorable side characters</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Several fun platforms and challenging obstacles</li></ul><br>This game will test your patience to the extreme. Good luck.<br><br>*This game is a student project created over a period of 9 weeks",
    "short_description": "Ok I Pull Up is a rage platformer, in which you, a capybara, ascend a tree tower only by jumping. This punishing, yet fair game requires extreme patience to complete.",
